<view class="page container">
  <view class="card advisor">
    <view class="advisor__title">开启您的专属之旅</view>
    <view class="advisor__q">· 不知道选什么专业？</view>
    <view class="advisor__q">· 不确定目标院校是否合理？</view>
    <view class="advisor__q">· 对未来方向感到模糊？</view>

    <view class="advisor__add">添加 <text class="text-primary text-bold">一对一专属生涯顾问</text> 一站解决：</view>
    <view class="advisor__benefit" wx:for="{{benefits}}" wx:key="*this">
      <text class="advisor__check">✓</text>{{item}}
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card advisor__qr-card">
    <view class="advisor__online"><text class="advisor__dot"></text>您的专属顾问，现已上线</view>
    <view class="advisor__qr" bindtap="previewQr">
      <!-- TODO: 替换为后端下发的企业微信活码图片 -->
      <view class="advisor__qr-placeholder">二维码</view>
    </view>
    <view class="advisor__qr-tip">长按识别添加</view>
  </view>

  <view class="advisor__foot">— 从迷茫到清晰，只差这一步 —</view>
</view>
